<title>USA: Quest Medical chairman resigns from board.</title>
<headline>Quest Medical chairman resigns from board.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quest Medical Inc board of directors said on Friday Chairman Richard Gilleland resigned from the board effective November 7, 1996.</p>
<p>Reasons for his resignation were not cited in the statement.</p>
<p>Quest Medical designs, develops, manufactures and markets a variety of health care products used primarily in cardiovascular surgery, interventional pain management and intravenous fluid delivery applications.</p>
</text>
